+  <text x="520" y="50" fill="#aeb4c7" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">The interpreter's operand fetch is two dependent loads and a cross-pipe transfer — all of it before the first useful FLOP</text>
+
