204:  <text x="652" y="450" fill="#53d8fb" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">ACROSS THE CORPUS</text>
205:  <text x="570" y="477" fill="#ffffff" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="700">26 of 26 circuits: SALU ratio below VALU ratio.</text>
