207:  <text x="570" y="518" fill="#9ba3b8" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10">Fewer scalar instructions throughout the corpus.</text>
211:  <text x="520" y="574" fill="#ffffff" font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">Specialization removes the serial prerequisites before useful arithmetic begins.</text>

